                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعَاهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He kept it in mind, and considered it.</i>
(Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعَى الحَدِيثَ</span>
                        <i>He kept,</i> or <i>retained,
the narration in his mind,</i> or <i>memory;</i> or <i>knew
it,</i> or <i>learned it, by heart;</i> and <i>studied it until
he knew it.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعَى</span>, aor. 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعِىَ</span></b> 
